    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Get One",
      "description" : "Retrieves details of a specific tool from the tool registry using its unique identifier. This operation returns the complete configuration and metadata of the requested tool, which can be used for inspection or assignment to agents.\n\nInput Parameters:\nuuid (string): Unique identifier of the tool in the registry to be retrieved.\n\nOutput Parameters:\ntools_registry (object): Detailed information of the requested tool from the registry.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure). (if applicable)\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails. (if applicable)"
    },
